;; The site build's own kbb/nbb config, deliberately empty.
;;
;; nbb walks up from the script to the first nbb.edn and, when that file has
;; :deps, shells out to `bb` to build a deps uberjar. The repository root's
;; nbb.edn has had :deps since beb40e1 (2026-09-24) for the test runner, and
;; the Cloudflare Workers Builds image has no `bb`, so every production site
;; build failed with `/bin/sh: 1: bb: not found` from then on. The site build
;; passes its whole classpath explicitly (site/build.cljk) and pins its
;; sources in site/build-dependencies.json, so it needs nothing from here.
;; site/kbb names this file with --config so the root one is never read.
{}
